{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは⛄️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、\nカウントダウンジャパンさんでの\nライブがありました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約1時間のライブで、\n全部で10曲を披露させて頂きました。\n久しぶりのライブだったので、良い汗をかけてとても楽しかったです✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイレントマジョリティー\nガラスを割れ!\nアンビバレント\n不協和音\nの最後4曲のセトリがとてもハードでした!\n不協和音での盛り上がりが凄かったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのタオルや声援、ありがとうございました☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"記念写真"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPNMEFNK57MY8WXXVNB3MW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">りこぴ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンプしてみたよ🐾"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPNND693M39D2E5PJMJZDG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">↓"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPNPDAEC4PCEMP423K52R5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">↓"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPNQCRX1G2N2KKDSZ79PND","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">↓"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPNRBBR7VS4C8R21XWPP8A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">りこぴの躍動感がすごい。\nぶれぶれになっちゃったけどいい写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ライブ後のイチゴ削りは至福でした🍓"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPNSBQAD3J9SSGERS1E39E","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n上の生クリームをイチゴソースに変えてもらったよ🤤💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装も久しぶりで嬉しかったな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPNTD8091Y7CNENVS9J15R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">左右の袖の作りが違うのが好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もあと残り3日、レコード大賞、紅白歌合戦も楽しんでいこうと思います٩(^‿^)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。\n長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}